insert into public.section_manuals(section_key,title,purpose,quick_start,workflow,warnings)
values('todo','My To-do — assignments and follow-up','Receive, delegate and follow up operational tasks with a checklist and recorded progress. Active Shareholders form the committee and assign only to the CEO.','Select Today & overdue, open an assignment, review the checklist, record progress by voice or text and save. Leaders see their received work above and delegated tasks below.',
'["Assign only to recipients allowed by the reporting hierarchy: committee to CEO; CEO to managers or supervisors; managers to direct supervisors; supervisors to direct operators/technicians.","Choose a scheduled date/time in Alberta, priority, instructions and checklist. Optionally link the task to one assigned to you, so child updates reach its owners.","Report progress and finish each required checklist step. Request completion when the work is ready for review.","The original assigner approves completion or returns the task with a note. Completed and cancelled tasks remain in the archive.","Use NEW UPDATE badges and the activity history to follow linked work. Opening a task marks only the activity you have actually loaded as seen.","Due maintenance plans and assigned Work Orders appear as schedule reminders when To-do refreshes. Calendar & Backlog opens the corresponding task."]',
'To-do does not authorize maintenance execution, purchases or spending, and cannot replace controlled Work Order approval. A linked WO must complete its own approval workflow before its task can finish. Task updates require a connection. Voice input availability depends on the phone/browser; review the text before saving. Notifications appear in the application, with periodic refresh; the system sends no SMS.');
